OL,3,GNEWSABridge closure costing firm
OL,4,A#500,000 a year
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn animal feed manufacturer says the
OL,7,Fclosure of a bridge is costing it an
OL,8,Fextra #500,000 a year, while other
OL,9,Fbusinesses are struggling with the
OL,10,Fimpact on trade.
OL,12,FA Christmas tree farm, pub and primary
OL,13,Fschool are among those affected by the
OL,14,Fclosure of the A530 at Baddington Lane,
OL,15,Fon a key route between Cheshire and
OL,16,FShropshire.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
