OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSABridge closure costing firm
OL,4,A#500,000 a year
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses and residents have
OL,7,Fcriticised Cheshire East Council,
OL,8,Farguing problems with the bridge should
OL,9,Fhave been addressed sooner, while the
OL,10,Fauthority says public safety must come
OL,11,Ffirst.
OL,13,F"To let it get to the point where it is
OL,14,Funusable I think is ridiculous,
OL,15,Ffrankly," said Edward Lea, whose animal
OL,16,Ffeed company is facing increased fuel
OL,17,Fand driver costs as a result of a
OL,18,F30-mile (48km) diversion.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
